Package: slcflights
Title: Salt Lake City Flight Records and Supporting Airport Coordinates
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Aleksey", "Kulyukin", , "aleksey.kulyukin.2022@gmail.com", 
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-4396-9878"))
Description: Provides Salt Lake City-focused subsets of the Bureau of
    Transportation Statistics (BTS) TranStats On-Time: Reporting Carrier
    On-Time Performance data. The installed Parquet files cover October 1987
    through June 2024 and are derived from the 1987--2024 Parquet files
    distributed for the 2025 ASA Data Expo Challenge. The package also includes
    airport coordinate metadata derived from the BTS TranStats Master Coordinate
    support table and a field dictionary describing selected data columns.
    Helper functions list available years, read selected years into memory,
    open Parquet files lazily, read airport coordinate metadata, read the field
    dictionary, and extend the installed data with newer BTS monthly releases in
    a local user cache.
